data: {"id": "773684f6e6f1498d-thinking-layer-364", "run_id": "773684f6e6f1498d", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 异常实体定位\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc`\n- **当前状态**: `Running`, `READY` 为 `0/1`\n- **异常类型**: `NotReadyProbeFailed` (Pod 运行但未就绪)\n\n### 异常组\n- **abnormal_group_1**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` (NotReadyProbeFailed)\n\n该 Pod 处于 Running 状态但未被标记为 Ready，通常意味着应用进程已启动，但健康检查（Readiness/Startup/Liveness Probe）失败，导致流量无法进入。需进一步检查探针配置及容器日志。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789089277158}

